  "id": "did:web:etzhayyim.github.io:com-etzhayyim-mikurabe",
  "name": "mikurabe",
  "displayName": "見比べ — Comparative Narrative-Framing Observer",
  "displayNameJa": "見比べ",
  "displayNameEn": "Mikurabe",
  "description": "Non-profit religious-corp actor that compares how a SAME topic-cluster (already-public kawaraban news-mirror articles or kouhou government briefings covering the same story) was FRAMED differently across the compared accounts, and publishes citation-grounded technique observations (omission / loaded-language / source-attribution-gap / emphasis-divergence / framing-order) to app-aozora. It is a downstream, passive-only consumer — it never fetches an outlet or government site itself, only what kawaraban/kouhou already made public. Containment (narrative-llm sealed) + independent NarrativeGovernor + append-only observation ledger. The single most important gate: NO field may score, rank, or label a country/government/outlet as a standing entity (schema-level unrepresentable, mirrors ooyake G11 exactly) — mikurabe never renders an opinion about a SOURCE, only about how ONE story was framed. A separate named-party PHASE gate (Council Lv6+ + SBT-vote, mirrors danjo G10) withholds publication of any observation that names a specific outlet/country until R2+; R0/R1 ship as fixture-only scaffold with a mock advisor and mock publisher — no live kawaraban/kouhou data is ever read, no named-party report has ever been published.",
  "descriptionJa": "kawaraban（news mirror）が既に公開した記事、または kouhou の政府発表ブリーフィングのうち、同一トピッククラスタを比較し、報じ方の技術的差異（省略・誘導表現・出典欠落・強調の違い・見出し選択の違い）を引用付きで app-aozora に投稿する actor。元サイトへの再取得は行わない受動的な downstream consumer。封じ込め（narrative-llm）+ 独立 NarrativeGovernor + append-only 観測台帳。最重要ゲート: 国家・政府・媒体そのものへの信頼度・ランク・レジーム評価はスキーマ層で表現不可能（ooyake G11 と同型）。特定の国・媒体を名指しする観測の公開は別途フェーズゲート（Council Lv6+ + SBT投票、R2+）で保留される。R0/R1 はフィクスチャのみの scaffold — mock advisor + mock publisher、実データ読み込みなし、named-party publication 実績ゼロ。",
  "tier": "Tier-B",
  "parentActor": null,
  "firstTouchChannelInvariant": "app-aozora — com.atproto.repo.createRecord (collection com.etzhayyim.apps.mikurabe.frameObservation). publication = SPEECH (Council-gated for named-party content); NOT actuation.",
  "lexicons": ["com.etzhayyim.apps.mikurabe.frameObservation"],
